*  RED, CHECKED IN RED (law 0d).  Same defect one generator over: ARB $ OUTPUT FAIL fires once
*  (oracle enumerates null/A/AB/ABC).  Falls with rty_fail_bal_inline -- ONE class, two members,
*  which is why neither may be cured by an op-conditioned admission (NO-PER-OP-FILTER).
 'ABC' ? POS(0) ARB $ OUTPUT FAIL
 OUTPUT = 'done'
END
